        <mxCell id="c54" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Napomene&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Korisnički redirect-i (Parking → PSP checkout → banka / PayPal → nazad) su na strani &lt;i&gt;3. Sekvenca&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Klijent → PSP: HMAC potpis (timestamp + nonce) i Idempotency-Key.&lt;br&gt;• PSP → klijent: potpisan webhook + klijent sam proverava status (reconciliation).&lt;br&gt;• Kredencijali provajdera postoje samo u odgovarajućem plugin-u; PAN vidi samo banka.&lt;br&gt;• Kafka teme i consumer grupe: strana &lt;i&gt;5. Kafka&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Model podataka i ostale sekvence: SEP_model_podataka.drawio, SEP_dijagrami_sekvenci.drawio." vertex="1">
